{"id":71354,"date":"2026-10-29T19:34:41","date_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:34:41","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71354"},"modified":"2026-10-29T20:36:42","modified_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:36:42","slug":"canicross-rota-da-castanha","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/canicross-rota-da-castanha\/","title":{"rendered":"4\u00ba Canicross &#8216;Rota da Castanha&#8217; \u2013 Sernancelhe 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">4\u00ba Canicross 'Rota da Castanha' \u2013 Sernancelhe 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>4\u00ba Canicross 'Rota da Castanha' \u2013 Sernancelhe 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>13 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), com in\u00edcio marcado para as <strong>09:00<\/strong> em <strong>Sernancelhe<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>. Em plena Terra da Castanha e nas paisagens gran\u00edticas das Terras do Demo imortalizadas por Aquilino Ribeiro, a prova re\u00fane duplas de atletas e c\u00e3es nos trilhos rurais e soutos do concelho.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo da 4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o contempla as vertentes competitivas de <strong>Canicross<\/strong>, <strong>Bikejoring<\/strong> (Open e N\u00f3rdico), <strong>Scooterjoring DS2<\/strong> (Open e N\u00f3rdico) e <strong>Triciclo DR4<\/strong> (Open e N\u00f3rdico), complementadas pelos escal\u00f5es jovens de <strong>Canicross Infantil<\/strong> (6 aos 10 anos e 11 aos 16 anos) e pelas vertentes de lazer de <strong>C\u00e3ominhada<\/strong> e <strong>Caminhada (sem c\u00e3o)<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Sernancelhe<\/strong> com o apoio de entidades locais, o evento promove a modalidade de mushing e o desporto de natureza no norte do distrito de Viseu. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech